        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gansevoort%2C_New_York",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The hamlet was an important stop on the Underground Railroad, close to Canada.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gansevoort%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Dutch Reformed Church and Gansevoort Mansion are listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
